  "title": "Whatever Happened To Digital Keys?",
  "summary": "Despite strong demand from both hotels and guests, digital keys have struggled to achieve widespread adoption due to infrastructure fragmentation, engineering complexity, and guest friction. By addressing all three barriers at once, unified platforms like Seam aim to make digital access scalable, practical, and truly seamless for hospitality operators.",
